        {
          "id": "elegant-opening",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 390,
          "content": "It is with great enthusiasm that I submit my application for the Full Stack Developer position at Antigravity. With over five years of experience crafting sophisticated web solutions and a deep appreciation for elegant code, I am drawn to Antigravity's reputation for excellence and innovation.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 100,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 300,
            "color": "#2d2a2e",
            "fontFamily": "Cormorant Garamond, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "elegant-body-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 510,
          "content": "In my current role, I have had the privilege of leading the development of sophisticated web applications that serve millions of users. My approach combines technical precision with aesthetic sensibility – I believe that great software should be as beautiful as it is functional. I have particular expertise in React, Next.js, and Node.js, and I take pride in writing code that is both elegant and maintainable.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 120,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 300,
            "color": "#2d2a2e",
            "fontFamily": "Cormorant Garamond, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "elegant-body-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 650,
          "content": "One of my most significant achievements was architecting a microservices platform that improved system performance by 40% while reducing technical debt. I have also integrated AI capabilities into applications, creating intelligent features that enhance user experience. My academic background includes a Bachelor's degree in Software Engineering from NUST, where I graduated with distinction.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 120,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 300,
            "color": "#2d2a2e",
            "fontFamily": "Cormorant Garamond, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "elegant-body-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 790,
          "content": "I am particularly drawn to Antigravity's commitment to pushing boundaries and creating products that make a difference. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute my skills and sensibilities to your esteemed organization.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 70,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 300,
            "color": "#2d2a2e",
            "fontFamily": "Cormorant Garamond, serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "elegant-closing",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 890,
          "content": "I look forward to the possibility of discussing this opportunity with you.",
          "style": {
